            "review_title": "Review at Chef House Halal Restaurant",
            "review_text": "MF C\n1 contribution\n1\nChef House Halal\nApr 2025 • Family\nJust had an incredible lunch at Chef House Halal Food with my family, and I'm still raving about the flavors! The standout dish for me was hands-down the Chicken Tikka Masala – it was love at first bite. The chicken was tender, juicy, and packed with spices that didn't overpower the dish, but rather elevated it to a whole new level.\nThe service was top-notch, too. Our server was attentive, friendly, and made sure we had everything we needed throughout our meal. The atmosphere was cozy and welcoming, making it the perfect spot for a family lunch.\nIf you're a fan of authentic, mouth-watering halal food, look no further than Chef House. The Chicken Tikka Masala is a must-try, and I'm already planning my next visit.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 7, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
